WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.616
IDENTIFY. Show Sun, Earth and Moon in a clearly not-to-scale diagram.

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.223
ORBIT. Demonstrate Earth travelling around the Sun.

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.181
ORBIT. Demonstrate Moon travelling around Earth.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.543
ROTATE. Show Earth turning to explain day and night.
